      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVTIMETODREAM NZ (3) resumes from a spell of six-and-a-half months after racing in Sydney at the end of last campaign, finishing second at Listed level two back at Menangle. Looked very good in winning three in a row here earlier in the year. Readied with two nice trials and draws for a winning return. CAMERINA (1) is hard to knock off back-to-back wins here, overcoming a back row draw in her latest. Stronger here but should have no excuses from the inside draw. MAGNETIC STORM (8) missed narrowly two back then atoned with a last-start win by a neck. Draws for a trail so can play a role again. FUGITIVE NZ (12) is an interesting newcomer to Chantal Turpin. Tricky draw but came from the widest barrier to win two back at Menangle. Generally comes to hand quickly, with two wins and a placing from four first-up appearances and placed in a trial here so keep safe.",
